  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>T</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is skew symmetric.</p><p>So det&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>so system have infinite solutions.</p>",
